<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Irohani Sakite"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="いろはに咲きて"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="盛开于伊吕波"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Isekaijoucho"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヰ世界情緒"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="异世界情绪"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Creation"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Irohani Sakite"/><amll:meta key="album" value="いろはに咲きて"/><amll:meta key="album" value="創生"/><amll:meta key="album" value="盛开于伊吕波"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602095250"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPZ922014596"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1907752041"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2040000001"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002XM1AS0ylQg6"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="003RgmcJ4DDBzK"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="336304145"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="406403673"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0j0BGyoHHtDESj2UiYCRCV"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5rss1y4jNan3I7xYK0CVGi"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1687474425"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1688352883"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:34.270"><div begin="7.200" end="3:34.270"><p begin="7.200" end="9.960" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.200" end="7.390">真</span><span begin="7.390" end="7.800">っ</span><span begin="7.800" end="8.050">赤</span><span begin="8.050" end="8.390">な</span><span begin="8.390" end="8.680">着</span><span begin="8.680" end="9.080">物</span><span begin="9.080" end="9.460">拵</span><span begin="9.460" end="9.560">え</span><span begin="9.730" end="9.960">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一袭赤红和服精心裁就</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一襲赤紅和服精心裁就</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Preparing a deep red kimono</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">새빨간 기모노를 지어 입고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Préparant un kimono d&apos;un rouge éclatant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Preparada con un kimono rojo intenso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein tiefrotes Kimono zurechtgelegt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com um quimono carmesim pronto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подготовив ярко-красное кимоно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Confezionando un kimono rosso acceso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Makka na kimono koshiraete</span></p><p begin="10.120" end="13.850" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.120" end="10.540">張</span><span begin="10.540" end="10.800">子</span><span begin="10.800" end="10.980">の</span><span begin="10.980" end="11.410">虎</span><span begin="11.410" end="11.630">の</span><span begin="11.820" end="12.240">指</span><span begin="12.240" end="12.440">を</span><span begin="12.440" end="12.890">重</span><span begin="12.890" end="13.110">ね</span><span begin="13.110" end="13.520">た</span><span begin="13.520" end="13.850">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将纸虎的指爪层层叠叠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將紙虎的指爪層層疊疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I layered the fingers of a papier-mache tiger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">종이 호랑이의 손가락을 겹친 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai superposé les griffes d&apos;un tigre de papier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Superpuse los dedos del tigre de papel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Tatzen des Papiertigers übereinandergelegt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sobrepôs os dedos de um tigre de papel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я сложила вместе пальцы бумажного тигра</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho intrecciato le dita della tigre di carta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hariko no tora no yubi o kasaneta no</span></p><p begin="13.910" end="16.710" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.910" end="14.180">葉</span><span begin="14.180" end="14.600">っ</span><span begin="14.600" end="14.810">ぱ</span><span begin="14.810" end="15.030">で</span><span begin="15.170" end="15.650">爪</span><span begin="15.650" end="15.840">は</span><span begin="15.840" end="16.260">隠</span><span begin="16.260" end="16.490">す</span><span begin="16.490" end="16.710">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用枝叶掩去利刃锋芒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">用枝葉掩去利刃鋒芒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hiding my claws with leaves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나뭇잎으로 발톱은 숨기는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je cache mes ongles sous les feuilles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oculto las garras con las hojas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verstecke die Krallen mit Blättern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esconde as garras com as folhas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скрываю когти листьями</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nascondo gli artigli con le foglie</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Happa de tume wa kakusu no</span></p><p begin="16.810" end="20.710" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.810" end="17.330">空</span><span begin="17.330" end="17.760">音</span> <span begin="17.980" end="18.180">撫</span><span begin="18.180" end="18.410">ぜ</span><span begin="18.410" end="18.600">る</span><span begin="18.600" end="19.020">為</span><span begin="19.020" end="20.710">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为抚响虚空之弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只為撫響虛空之弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In order to stroke the empty sound</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">허공의 소리를 어루만지기 위해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour caresser le faux son</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para acariciar el sonido del vacío</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Um den leeren Klang zu streicheln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para acariciar o som do vazio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы коснуться пустого звука</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per accarezzare il suono vacuo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sorane nazeru tame ni</span></p><p begin="21.550" end="22.790" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.550" end="21.780">ぱ</span><span begin="21.970" end="22.190">ぱ</span><span begin="22.400" end="22.790">ぱ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">帕 帕 帕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">帕 帕 帕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">파파파</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Па-па-па</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Pa pa pa</span></p><p begin="24.930" end="26.190" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.930" end="25.200">ぱ</span><span begin="25.350" end="25.620">ぱ</span><span begin="25.770" end="26.190">ぱ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">帕 帕 帕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">帕 帕 帕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">파파파</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Па-па-па</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Pa pa pa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Pa pa pa</span></p><p begin="27.370" end="30.260" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.370" end="27.700">薄</span><span begin="28.090" end="28.320">荷</span><span begin="28.320" end="28.620">の</span><span begin="28.620" end="29.140">花</span><span begin="29.140" end="29.330">に</span><span begin="29.330" end="29.850">誓</span><span begin="29.850" end="30.020">っ</span><span begin="30.020" end="30.260">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着薄荷花丛立下誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對著薄荷花叢立下誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Swearing upon the mint flowers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">박하꽃에 맹세코</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jurant sur les fleurs de menthe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Jurando ante las flores de menta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schwöre bei den Blüten der Minze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Jurando pelas flores de hortelã</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поклявшись цветам мяты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Giurando sui fiori di menta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hakka no hana ni chikatte</span></p><p begin="30.410" end="34.230" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.410" end="30.820">唐</span><span begin="30.820" end="31.700">紅</span><span begin="31.700" end="31.920">の</span><span begin="32.130" end="32.540">嘘</span><span begin="32.540" end="32.750">を</span><span begin="32.750" end="33.180">重</span><span begin="33.180" end="33.390">ね</span><span begin="33.390" end="33.810">た</span><span begin="33.810" end="34.230">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叠加深绯的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">疊加深緋的謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I layered crimson lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진홍빛 거짓말을 거듭한 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai superposé les mensonges cramoisis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Superpuse mentiras de color carmesí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe scharlachrote Lügen aufgehäuft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sobrepôs mentiras carmesins</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я множила багряную ложь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho sovrapposto bugie color cremisi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Karakurenai no uso o kasaneta no</span></p><p begin="34.230" end="37.150" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.230" end="35.090">唯</span><span begin="35.090" end="35.430">の</span><span begin="35.430" end="35.910">一</span><span begin="35.910" end="36.090">つ</span><span begin="36.090" end="36.340">で</span><span begin="36.340" end="36.560">好</span><span begin="36.560" end="36.780">い</span><span begin="36.780" end="37.150">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需唯一的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只需唯一的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just a single one is fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">단 하나면 족해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un seul me suffit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con una sola basta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur ein einziger ist genug</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Basta apenas um</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Достаточно лишь одного</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Me ne basta una sola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada no hitotsu de ii no</span></p><p begin="37.150" end="39.720" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.150" end="37.540">約</span><span begin="37.540" end="38.400">束</span><span begin="38.400" end="38.680">を</span><span begin="38.680" end="39.070">教</span><span begin="39.070" end="39.270">え</span><span begin="39.270" end="39.720">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我约定的形状</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請告訴我約定的形狀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tell me the promise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">약속을 가르쳐 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Apprends-moi la promesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dime la promesa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verrate mir das Versprechen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Me ensine a promessa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расскажи мне об обещании</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimmi la forma della promessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yakusoku o oshiete</span></p><p begin="39.920" end="43.730" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.920" end="40.560">容</span><span begin="40.560" end="40.780">の</span><span begin="40.780" end="40.990">無</span><span begin="40.990" end="41.450">い</span> <span begin="41.580" end="41.840">こ</span><span begin="41.840" end="42.340">の</span><span begin="42.340" end="42.650">詩</span><span begin="42.650" end="43.100">想</span><span begin="43.100" end="43.330">の</span><span begin="43.330" end="43.730">庭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这无形诗想的庭院</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這無形詩想的庭院</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This formless garden of poetic imagination</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">형태 없는 이 시상의 정원</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans le jardin de cette pensée sans forme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Este jardín de pensamientos poéticos sin forma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In diesem formlosen Garten der Poesie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Neste jardim de pensamentos sem forma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бесформенном саду поэзии</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo giardino di poesie senza forma</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Katachi no nai kono shisou no niwa</span></p><p begin="43.910" end="47.320" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.910" end="44.150">木</span><span begin="44.150" end="44.370">々</span><span begin="44.370" end="44.790">の</span><span begin="44.790" end="45.490">奥</span><span begin="45.490" end="46.050">深</span><span begin="46.050" end="47.320">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">林木幽深之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">林木幽深之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Deep within the trees</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">숲속 깊은 곳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au plus profond des bois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En lo profundo de los árboles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Tief im Inneren der Bäume</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nas profundezas das árvores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В самой глубине леса</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel profondo degli alberi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kigi no okufukaku</span></p><p begin="47.730" end="50.490" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.730" end="48.040">ぱ</span><span begin="48.040" end="48.340">っ</span><span begin="48.340" end="48.530">と</span><span begin="48.530" end="49.000">花</span><span begin="49.000" end="49.200">咲</span><span begin="49.200" end="49.440">け</span> <span begin="49.440" end="49.860">艶</span><span begin="49.860" end="50.050">や</span><span begin="50.050" end="50.280">か</span><span begin="50.280" end="50.490">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骤然绽放吧 秾艳绝伦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">驟然綻放吧 穠艷絕倫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Bloom suddenly and glamorously</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">팟 하고 꽃 피어라 요염하게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fleuris soudainement avec éclat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Florece de golpe con elegancia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Erblühe plötzlich in voller Pracht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desabroche de repente e radiante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расцветай мгновенно и пышно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sbocciate all&apos;improvviso con eleganza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Patto hana sake adeyaka ni</span></p><p begin="50.700" end="54.360" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.700" end="51.480">嘯</span><span begin="51.480" end="51.980">く</span><span begin="51.980" end="52.810">様</span><span begin="52.810" end="54.360">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同在嘲弄世间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同在嘲弄世間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As if to roar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시치미를 떼듯이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme pour te moquer du monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si estuviera burlándome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als ob man spottet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se estivesse zombando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно насмехаясь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come per deridere il mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Usobuku you ni</span></p><p begin="55.460" end="58.870"