ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">界限本就曖昧不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Boundaries are ambiguous aren&apos;t they</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">경계 따위 애매하잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La frontière n&apos;est-elle pas ambiguë ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las fronteras son ambiguas verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Grenzen sind doch vage oder?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As fronteiras são vagas não é?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Границы ведь так туманны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I confini sono ambigui vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyoukai nante aimai deshou</span></p><p begin="1:08.980" end="1:12.270" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.980" end="1:09.720">光</span> <span begin="1:09.720" end="1:10.140">浴</span><span begin="1:10.140" end="1:10.560">び</span><span begin="1:10.560" end="1:10.790">な</span><span begin="1:10.790" end="1:10.990">が</span><span begin="1:10.990" end="1:11.200">ら</span><span begin="1:11.200" end="1:11.830">煌</span><span begin="1:11.830" end="1:12.050">め</span><span begin="1:12.050" end="1:12.270">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沐着天光 璀璨生辉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沐著天光 璀璨生輝吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sparkle while bathing in the light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빛을 머금으며 반짝여라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Scintille en te baignant de lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Brilla mientras te bañas en la luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Funkle während du im Licht badest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Brilhe enquanto se banha na luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сверкай купаясь в лучах света</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang