n><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Einen Fluch aussprechend Festgetümmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lançando uma maldição a euforia do festival</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Накладывая проклятье в праздничном шуме</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lanciando una maledizione nel baccano del festival</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Negai kakete matsuri sawagi</span></p><p begin="1:30.020" end="1:32.740" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.020" end="1:30.250">待</span><span begin="1:30.250" end="1:30.650">っ</span><span begin="1:30.650" end="1:30.870">た</span><span begin="1:30.870" end="1:31.260">は</span><span begin="1:31.260" end="1:31.500">掛</span><span begin="1:31.500" end="1:31.720">け</span><span begin="1:31.720" end="1:31.940">ら</span><span begin="1:31.940" end="1:32.140">れ</span><span begin="1:32.140" end="1:32.340">な</span><span begin="1:32.340" end="1:32.550">い</span><span begin="1:32.550" end="1:32.740">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既无法叫停</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既無法叫停</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Saying I cannot call a pause</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멈출 수는 없다고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Disant qu&apos;on ne peut pas s&apos;arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dicen que no se puede detener</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass man nicht Einhalt gebieten kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dizendo que não há como parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Говоря что нельзя медлить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza poter chiedere una pausa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Matta wa kakerarenai to</span></p><p begin="1:32.950" end="1:36.700" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.950" end="1:33.610">抗</span><span begin="1:33.610" end="1:33.820">え</span><span begin="1:33.820" end="1:34.020">な</span><span begin="1:34.020" end="1:34.220">い</span><span begin="1:34.220" end="1:34.450">と</span> <span begin="1:34.650" end="1:34.860">老</span><span begin="1:34.860" end="1:35.040">い</span><span begin="1:35.040" end="1:35.260">を</span><span begin="1:35.260" end="1:35.720">重</span><span begin="1:35.720" end="1:35.910">ね</span><span begin="1:35.910" end="1:36.340">た</span><span begin="1:36.340" end="1:36.700">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亦无从抗拒 便与衰老共生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">亦無從抗拒 便與衰老共生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Saying I cannot resist I grew older</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저항할 수 없다고 늙어간 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Disant qu&apos;on ne peut pas résister j&apos;ai vieilli</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que no se puede resistir y acumulé la vejez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass man nicht widerstehen kann das Altern gehäuft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dizendo que não há como resistir envelheceu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не в силах сопротивляться я принимала старость</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza poter resistere ho accumulato gli anni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aragaenai to oi o kasaneta no</span></p><p begin="1:36.770" end="1:39.510" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.770" end="1:37.000">参</span><span begin="1:37.400" end="1:37.610">つ</span><span begin="1:37.610" end="1:37.930">の</span><span begin="1:37.930" end="1:38.230">御</span><span begin="1:38.230" end="1:38.650">伽</span><span begin="1:38.650" end="1:39.300">噺</span><span begin="1:39.300" end="1:39.510">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连三重童话故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連三重童話故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the three fairy tales</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세 가지 옛날이야기도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les trois contes de fées</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso los tres cuentos de hadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar die drei Märchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até os três contos de fada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже три сказки</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persino le tre fiabe</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mittsu no otogibanashi mo</span></p><p begin="1:39.720" end="1:42.260" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.720" end="1:39.940">ほ</span><span begin="1:39.940" end="1:40.160">ら</span><span begin="1:40.160" end="1:40.370">ね</span> <span begin="1:40.500" end="1:40.970">信</span><span begin="1:40.970" end="1:41.230">じ</span><span begin="1:41.230" end="1:41.410">る</span><span begin="1:41.410" end="1:41.620">の</span><span begin="1:41.620" end="1:41.810">で</span><span begin="1:41.810" end="1:41.890">し</span><span begin="1:41.890" end="1:42.080">ょ</span><span begin="1:42.080" end="1:42.260">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看啊 你也深信不疑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看啊 你也深信不疑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">See you believe them don&apos;t you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거봐 믿는 거잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vois-tu tu vas y croire n&apos;est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mira los vas a creer verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Siehst du du glaubst es sicher oder?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Veja você vai acreditar não é?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Видишь ты ведь тоже веришь в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedi ci credi vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Horane shinjiru no deshou</span></p><p begin="1:42.450" end="1:46.270" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.450" end="1:42.890">中</span><span begin="1:42.890" end="1:43.120">味</span><span begin="1:43.120" end="1:43.320">は</span> <span begin="1:43.320" end="1:43.530">有</span><span begin="1:43.530" end="1:44.160">象</span><span begin="1:44.160" end="1:44.380">無</span><span begin="1:44.380" end="1:45.220">象</span><span begin="1:45.220" end="1:45.390">の</span><span begin="1:45.390" end="1:45.850">葬</span><span begin="1:45.850" end="1:46.270">列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内里实为众生送葬行列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">內裡實為眾生送葬行列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The inside is a funeral procession of the masses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 속은 어중이떠중이들의 장례 행렬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le contenu est une procession funéraire de gens ordinaires</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El interior es un desfile fúnebre de una multitud ruidosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Inhalt ist der Trauerzug der Namenlosen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O interior é um cortejo fúnebre das massas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Внутри лишь похоронная процессия толпы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il contenuto è un corteo funebre di gente comune</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nakami wa uzou muzou no souretsu</span></p><p begin="1:46.480" end="1:49.850" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.480" end="1:46.670">無</span><span begin="1:46.670" end="1:47.340">数</span><span begin="1:47.340" end="1:47.710">の</span><span begin="1:47.710" end="1:48.160">火</span><span begin="1:48.160" end="1:48.480">玉</span><span begin="1:48.480" end="1:48.610">を</span><span begin="1:48.610" end="1:49.040">連</span><span begin="1:49.040" end="1:49.440">れ</span><span begin="1:49.440" end="1:49.850">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携着无数魂火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">攜著無數魂火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Bringing countless fireballs along</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무수한 도깨비불을 이끌고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Accompagnée d&apos;innombrables feux follets</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Acompañada de incontables bolas de fuego</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zahllose Irrlichter mit sich führend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levando inúmeras bolas de fogo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведя за собой мириады огней</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Portando con me innumerevoli fuochi fatui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Musuu no hidama o tsurete</span></p><p begin="1:50.270" end="1:53.190" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.270" end="1:50.820">ぱ</span><span begin="1:50.820" end="1:50.920">っ</span><span begin="1:50.920" end="1:51.100">と</span><span begin="1:51.100" end="1:51.370">斬</span><span begin="1:51.370" end="1:51.520">り</span><span begin="1:51.520" end="1:51.760">裂</span><span begin="1:51.760" end="1:51.980">け</span> <span begin="1:51.980" end="1:52.180">派</span><span begin="1:52.180" end="1:52.410">手</span><span begin="1:52.410" end="1:52.590">や</span><span begin="1:52.590" end="1:52.830">か</span><span begin="1:52.830" end="1:53.190">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骤然斩裂吧 绚烂张扬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">驟然斬裂吧 絢爛張揚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Slash suddenly and flashily</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">팟 하고 베어 갈라라 화려하게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tranche soudainement avec splendeur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desgarra de golpe con ostentación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schneide es jäh auf prachtvoll</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Corte de repente e chamativa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрубай мгновенно и ярко</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Squarciate all&apos;improvviso con sfarzo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Patto kirisake hadeyaka ni</span></p><p begin="1:53.570" end="1:58.700" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.570" end="1:54.250">飛</span><span begin="1:54.250" end="1:54.940">沫</span><span begin="1:54.940" end="1:55.350">を</span><span begin="1:55.350" end="1:56.190">挙</span><span begin="1:56.190" end="1:57.040">げ</span><span begin="1:57.040" end="1:58.700">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">溅起万千飞沫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">濺起萬千飛沫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Raising splashes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">물보라를 흩날리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En soulevant des éclaboussures</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Levantando el rocío</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Fontänen auslösend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levantando respingos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поднимая брызги</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sollevando spruzzi d&apos;acqua</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shibuki o agete</span></p><p begin="2:24.050" end="2:30.440" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.050" end="2:25.340">私</span><span begin="2:25.340" end="2:25.740">の</span><span begin="2:25.740" end="2:27.050">命</span><span begin="2:27.050" end="2:27.400">は</span><span begin="2:27.400" end="2:28.300">生</span><span begin="2:28.300" end="2:29.060">生</span><span begin="2:29.060" end="2:29.980">世</span><span begin="2:29.980" end="2:30.440">世</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的生命在生生世世轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的生命在生生世世輪迴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My life spans across lifetimes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나의 목숨은 생생세세</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma vie est une succession de renaissances</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi vida es por los siglos de los siglos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Leben währt über alle Welten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A minha vida é eterna em todas as existências</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Моя жизнь длится из века в век</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La mia vita rinasce in eterno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi no inochi wa shoujou seizei</span></p><p begin="2:30.840" end="2:37.220" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.840" end="2:31.190">活</span><span begin="2:31.190" end="2:31.630">か</span><span begin="2:31.630" end="2:32.090">す</span><span begin="2:32.090" end="2:32.510">も</span><span begin="2:32.510" end="2:32.960">地</span><span begin="2:32.960" end="2:33.670">獄</span> <span begin="2:34.190" end="2:35.010">殺</span><span begin="2:35.010" end="2:35.490">す</span><span begin="2:35.490" end="2:35.850">も</span><span begin="2:35.850" end="2:36.320">地</span><span begin="2:36.320" end="2:37.220">獄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生亦地狱 死亦地狱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生亦地獄 死亦地獄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To let live is hell and to kill is hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살려두는 것도 지옥 죽이는 것도 지옥</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vivre est un enfer mourir est un enfer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vivir es un infierno morir es un infierno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Leben zu lassen ist die Hölle zu töten ist die Hölle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Viver é um inferno matar é um inferno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ад позволить жить и ад убить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciare in vita è un inferno uccidere è un inferno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikasu mo jigoku korosu mo jigoku</span></p><p begin="2:37.620" end="2:43.890" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.620" end="2:38.030">御</span><span begin="2:38.030" end="2:38.880">前</span><span begin="2:38.880" end="2:39.260">の</span><span begin="2:39.260" end="2:40.570">命</span><span begin="2:40.570" end="2:40.950">を</span><span begin="2:40.950" end="2:41.400">呉</span><span begin="2:41.400" end="2:41.840">れ</span><span begin="2:41.840" end="2:42.260">な</span><span begin="2:42.260" end="2:42.660">い</span><span begin="2:42.660" end="2:43.890">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可否将你的性命献予我？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可否將你的性命獻予我？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Won&apos;t you give me your life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그대의 목숨을 내게 주지 않겠나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me donneras-tu pas ta vie ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me darías tu vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Willst du mir nicht dein Leben geben?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você não me daria a sua vida?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не отдашь ли ты мне свою жизнь?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi darai la tua vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omae no inochi o kurenai ka</span></p><p begin="2:44.390" end="2:49.450" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.390" end="2:45.220">月</span><span begin="2:45.220" end="2:45.610">夜</span><span begin="2:45.610" end="2:46.060">が</span><span begin="2:46.060" end="2:47.300">満</span><span begin="2:47.300" end="2:47.820">ち</span><span begin="2:48.170" end="2:49.450">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月华渐满盈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">月華漸滿盈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The moonlit night becomes full</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">달밤이 차오른다</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La nuit de pleine lune se lève</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La noche de luna se llena</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Mondnacht erfüllt sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A noite enluarada se enche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лунная ночь полнится светом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La notte di luna è piena</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsukiyo ga michiru</span></p><p begin="2:50.380" end="2:53.790" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.380" end="2:50.690">ひ</span><span begin="2:50.690" end="2:50.930">ら</span><span begin="2:50.930" end="2:51.130">り</span> <span begin="2:51.130" end="2:51.560">あ</span><span begin="2:51.560" end="2:51.970">り</span><span begin="2:51.970" end="2:52.200">ふ</span><span begin="2:52.200" end="2:52.380">れ</span><span begin="2:52.380" end="2:52.600">て</span><span begin="2:52.600" end="2:53.220">純</span><span begin="2:53.220" end="2:53.790">情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">翩跹流转 庸常纯情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">翩躚流轉 庸常純情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Fluttering mundane pure heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사르르 흔해 빠진 순정</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voltigeant pureté ordinaire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Revoloteando una pureza ordinaria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Flatternd banale Unschuld</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Flutuando uma pureza comum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Порхающая банальная чистота</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Leggera un&apos;ordinaria purez