不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Boundaries are after all ambiguous aren&apos;t they</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">경계 따위 도저히 애매하잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La frontière est de toute façon ambiguë n&apos;est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las fronteras son totalmente ambiguas verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Grenzen sind doch gänzlich vage oder?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As fronteiras afinal são vagas não é?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Границы ведь в конечном счёте туманны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I confini dopotutto sono ambigui vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyoukai nante toutei aimai deshou</span></p><p begin="3:03.950" end="3:07.250" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.950" end="3:04.660">光</span> <span begin="3:04.660" end="3:05.070">浴</span><span begin="3:05.070" end="3:05.490">び</span><span begin="3:05.490" end="3:05.720">な</span><span begin="3:05.720" end="3:05.930">が</span><span begin="3:05.930" end="3:06.080">ら</span><span begin="3:06.080" end="3:06.760">煌</span><span begin="3:06.760" end="3:06.980">め</span><span begin="3:06.980" end="3:07.250">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沐着天光 璀璨生辉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沐著天光 璀璨生輝吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sparkle while bathing in the light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빛을 머금으며 반짝여라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Scintille en te baignant de lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Brilla mientras te bañas en la luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Funkle während du im Licht badest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Brilhe enquanto se banha na luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сверкай купаясь в лучах света</span><sp