tion" xml:lang="it">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">A a</span></span></p><p begin="3:12.240" end="3:13.860" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.240" end="3:12.680">末</span><span begin="3:12.680" end="3:13.110">代</span><span begin="3:13.110" end="3:13.520">ま</span><span begin="3:13.520" end="3:13.860">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至万代千秋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">直至萬代千秋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">For all generations to come</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">후세까지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jusqu&apos;à la fin des temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hasta la posteridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bis in alle Ewigkeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até as próximas gerações</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">До скончания веков</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fino alla fine dei tempi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Matsudai made</span></p><p begin="3:14.140" end="3:18.230" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.140" end="3:14.620">呪</span><span begin="3:14.620" end="3:14.780">い</span><span begin="3:14.780" end="3:15.390">か</span><span begin="3:15.390" end="3:16.060">け</span><span begin="3:16.060" end="3:16.680">て</span> <span begin="3:16.680" end="3:17.120">祭</span><span begin="3:17.120" end="3:17.320">り</span><span begin="3:17.320" end="3:17.750">騒</span><span begin="3:17.750" end="3:18.230">ぎ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">降下诅咒 祭典狂欢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">降下詛咒 祭典狂歡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Casting a curse in a festive clamor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">저주를 걸고서 축제 한마당</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Lance une malédiction un festival agité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lanzando una maldición un alboroto de festival</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Einen Fluch aussprechend Festgetümmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lançando uma maldição a euforia do festival</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Накладывая проклятье в праздничном шуме</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lanciando una maledizione nel baccano del festival</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Negai kakete matsuri sawagi</span></p><p begin="3:21.570" end="3:24.320" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.570" end="3:21.750">真</span><span begin="3:21.750" end="3:22.150">っ</span><span begin="3:22.150" end="3:22.830">新</span><span begin="3:22.830" end="3:23.050">な</span><span begin="3:23.050" end="3:23.270">画</span><span begin="3:23.270" end="3:23.470">を</span><span begin="3:23.470" end="3:23.900">描</span><span begin="3:23.900" end="3:24.000">い</span><span begin="3:24.110" end="3:24.320">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘全新的画卷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">描繪全新的畫卷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Drawing a brand new picture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">새하얀 그림을 그리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dessinant un tout nouveau tableau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dibujando una imagen completamente nueva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein brandneues Bild zeichnend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desenhando uma imagem nova em folha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Рисуя совершенно новую картину</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dipingendo un quadro nuovo di zecca</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Massara na e o egaite</span></p><p begin="3:24.510" end="3:28.310" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.510" end="3:24.750">何</span><span begin="3:24.750" end="3:24.940">時</span><span begin="3:24.940" end="3:25.180">何</span><span begin="3:25.180" end="3:25.360">時</span><span begin="3:25.360" end="3:25.780">迄</span><span begin="3:25.780" end="3:26.010">も</span><span begin="3:26.200" end="3:26.620">夢</span><span begin="3:26.620" end="3:26.870">を</span><span begin="3:26.870" end="3:27.050">視</span><span begin="3:27.050" end="3:27.270">て</span><span begin="3:27.270" end="3:27.480">い</span><span begin="3:27.480" end="3:27.900">た</span><span begin="3:27.900" end="3:28.310">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远永远凝望着梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">永遠永遠凝望著夢境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I was dreaming forever and ever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언제 언제까지나 꿈을 꾸고 있었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je regardais ce rêve à jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siempre siempre estuve viendo un sueño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe für immer und ewig geträumt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu estava sonhando para todo o sempre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я вечно видела сны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guardavo sempre i sogni per sempre</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsu itsu made mo yume o mite ita no</span></p><p begin="3:28.310" end="3:34.270" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.310" end="3:28.620">ま</span><span begin="3:28.940" end="3:29.140">た</span><span begin="3:29.140" end="3:29.820">独</span><span begin="3:29.820" end="3:30.010">り</span><span begin="3:30.010" end="3:30.890">で</span><span begin="3:31.270" end="3:31.870">眠</span><span begin="3:32.160" end="3:34.270">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度独自沉眠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再度獨自沉眠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I sleep alone again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 홀로 잠들어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je m&apos;endors seule à nouveau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vuelvo a dormir sola</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schlafe wieder allein ein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dormindo sozinha de novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И снова засыпаю в одиночестве</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E torno a dormire da sola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata hitori de nemuru</span></p></div></body></tt>